        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Solid Brass Traditional  8 Inch Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHigh quality solid brass door pull that is not to plain, but not to fancy. This is our one of our best selling shower door pulls. Available in your choice of <b>6 finish colors</b>. The 8 Inch Back to Back Shower Door Pulls are packaged with all the hardware for back to back mounting (pulls hook to each other) on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. Requires minimum 3/8\" diameter hole in glass. The 8\" Decorative Door Pull is 1\" diameter with a 2-15/16\" projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DP2574-Specifications.gif?v=1704354532\" width=\"422\" height=\"173\" border=\"0\" atl=\"SD-DP2574 Back-to-Back 8 Inch C-Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/10-inch-back-to-back-shower-door-pulls-sd-dp2575\"><b>10 Inch Shower Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the SD-DP2574 Glass Shower Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Back to Back Glass Door Kit</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SD-DP2574.pdf?v=1704262234\" target=\"new\"><b>SD-DP2574 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "8 Inch Back to Back Shower Door Pulls | SD-DP2574",
                "description": "Solid Brass 8 Inch Shower Door Pulls SD-DP2574 - High quality solid brass door pull that is not to plain, but not to fancy. This is our one of our best selling shower door pulls. Available in your choice of the 6 finish colors.  The 8 Inch Back to Back Shower Door Pulls are packaged with all the hardware for back to back mounting (pulls hook to each other) on 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower doors. The 8 inch decorative door pull  has a 1 inch diameter with a 2-15/16 inch projection.",
